🔥 Why Do We Need System Calls?

Suppose Chrome wants:

Open File

Can Chrome directly access SSD?

❌ No

It asks OS.

Suppose VS Code wants:

Allocate Memory

Can VS Code directly take RAM?

❌ No

Must ask OS.

Suppose WhatsApp wants:

Send Data Over Internet

Must ask OS.

Therefore:

Application
     ↓
System Call
     ↓
Operating System
🚀 What Happens During a System Call?

Suppose:

read(file);

is executed.

Step 1

Application running in User Mode.

User Mode
Step 2

System Call invoked.

Step 3

CPU switches:

User Mode
      ↓
Kernel Mode
Step 4

Kernel performs operation.

Step 5

Kernel returns result.

Step 6

CPU switches back.

Kernel Mode
      ↓
User Mode

